  "notes": "{変動|へんどう} refers to changes or fluctuations, often in economic or environmental contexts.\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {気候|きこう}{変動|へんどう}: climate change\n- {価格|かかく}{変動|へんどう}: price fluctuation\n- {為替|かわせ}{変動|へんどう}: exchange rate fluctuation\n- {変動|へんどう}{相場|そうば}: floating exchange rate\n\nPATTERNS:\n- {変動|へんどう}する: to fluctuate, to change\n- {変動|へんどう}が{激|はげ}しい: fluctuations are severe",
